  (text "DESIGN NOTES"
    (at 80 70 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)))
    (uuid "36a75f5d-9064-4493-b2b9-19ceef41148e")
  )
  (text "1. SET U1 OUTPUT TO 5.0 V BEFORE PLUGGING IN U2. The MP1584 output is set by a trimpot;"
    (at 80 76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "b403037e-53e7-4ca6-a19d-4e7756cca75c")
  )
  (text "the as-shipped setting is arbitrary and will destroy the D1 mini if it is above 5 V."
    (at 80 80.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "3dcea972-5fa5-4277-8609-91933a5ebde3")
  )
  (text "2. R1 IS THE ACCURACY-CRITICAL PART: 100R 0.1%, <=50 ppm/K metal film, >=0.25 W."
    (at 80 86.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "8c5309d6-0e4c-401a-b139-2c46c4ce1751")
  )
  (text "Carbon drifts up to 1000 ppm/K and the shed sees -10 to +40 C. Do not substitute."
    (at 80 90.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "c25479ce-db13-46e2-bdc0-c72dfb230beb")
  )
  (text "3. GROUND ROUTING: take R1's low side directly to U3's GND pin, not through the ESP's"
    (at 80 97.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "4ebfc63c-a4fe-4bcf-8c35-f5ee9f1d1f31")
  )
  (text "return path. 200 mA of WiFi burst through shared ground = ~2 mV = 0.12 % of full scale."
    (at 80 101.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "667c08d4-1983-4b65-89c7-25e8cf80f5d1")
  )
  (text "4. Burden: 4 mA = 0.400 V, 20 mA = 2.000 V, cable break = 0.000 V. The 0 V reading is"
    (at 80 107.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "0df8178c-626f-4a58-ac4f-ec33297ed188")
  )
  (text "what separates a broken cable from an empty tank. Calibrate two-point across R1."
    (at 80 112.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "ccc428e2-9c11-4b0f-807d-0fcea97ebfbe")
  )
  (text "5. NO INPUT PROTECTION FITTED - no fuse, no reverse-polarity diode, no TVS. Feed only"
    (at 80 118.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "1eff8375-e152-44d9-9e63-bc14f1594a10")
  )
  (text "from a known-good 19 V PSU, and check J1 polarity before every power-up."
    (at 80 122.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "0968e8b1-19e2-49a6-a9c1-37521bf2621d")
  )
  (text "6. J2 POLARITY MUST BE SILKSCREENED. A reversed probe reads 0 mA - indistinguishable"
    (at 80 129 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "d267efe4-2298-4fef-a12e-74aafdd1a1f7")
  )
  (text "from a cable break. Probe needs <17 V compliance (19 V minus the 2 V burden drop)."
    (at 80 133.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "a1393110-b5c8-47c5-95c0-38c746fca4bf")
